., along with its affiliated entities, functions exclusively as an online retail enterprise within the United States. Through its primary website, chewy.com, and its mobile applications, the company provides a comprehensive range of products and services tailored for nearly every type of domestic companion, including canines, felines, aquatic pets, birds, small mammals, horses, and even reptiles. Customers can procure everything from essential pet food and treats to necessary supplies, prescribed medications, and other health and wellness items. This extensive inventory includes roughly 100,000 unique products supplied by approximately 3,000 different partner brands. Chewy was established in 2010 and maintains its corporate headquarters in Dania Beach, Florida.","description_en":"Chewy, Inc., along with its affiliated entities, functions exclusively as an online retail enterprise within the United States. Through its primary website, chewy.com, and its mobile applications, the company provides a comprehensive range of products and services tailored for nearly every type of domestic companion, including canines, felines, aquatic pets, birds, small mammals, horses, and even reptiles. Customers can procure everything from essential pet food and treats to necessary supplies, prescribed medications, and other health and wellness items. This extensive inventory includes roughly 100,000 unique products supplied by approximately 3,000 different partner brands. Chewy was established in 2010 and maintains its corporate headquarters in Dania Beach, Florida.","description_zh":"Chewy, Inc.（美股代碼：CHWY）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Specialty Retail 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"7700 West Sunrise Boulevard","city":"Plantation","state":"FL","zip":"33322","country":"US","phone":"786 320 7111","full_address":"7700 West Sunrise Boulevard, Plantation, FL 33322, US","range_52w":"17.4-37.34","year_high":37.34,"year_low":17.4,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":17.4,"inst_ownership_pct":